tool.liquify.name = Liquify
tool.liquify.description = Tindá, balusá, kɔtisá to vimbisá bapiksele na nse ya brɔsi ya monene — mode nde eponaka oyo ekosalema. Mbongwana eyanganaka na monyama ya milɔngɔ oyo ekangani mpe esalelamaka na kalke ntango ondimi.
