tool.puppet_warp.name = Kopengolisa lokola pupɛ
tool.puppet_warp.description = Finá mpo na kokanga kalke na bapwɛ mosusu, na nsima benda moko: monyama ya milɔngɔ oyo ekangani egumbamaka zingazinga ya bapwɛ oyo ekangami, na makasi to na pɛtɛɛ ndenge opsio ya Bokasi elobi. Soki ondimi, mbongwana esalelamaka.
